<title>USA: Crestar Financial to buy back 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Crestar Financial to buy back 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crestar Financial Corp said on Friday it will repurchase up to 2 million shares in the next 12 months to meet the needs of its dividend reinvestment, thrift and profit-sharing plans.</p>
<p>Crestar has 109.9 million shares outstanding. They were trading Friday at 37-1/4, after closing at 37 on Thursday. The 52-week high was 38-1/8.</p>
<p>Crestar is the holding company for Crestar Bank.</p>
